NORWICH FIRE DISTRICT  







PRUDENTIAL COMMITTEE MINUTES 
April 27, 2020 
Present:  PC voting members:  Michael Goodrich, Alicia Groft, Elliot Harik; Water Department:  
Sam Eaton, Mike Tebbets; Treasurer:  Cheryl Lindberg; Clerk:  Steve Allen 

The meeting was called to order at 3:29 p.m. As has been the case for all meetings after March 
2, this was virtual and conducted by teleconference. 

1. The day's agenda was moved, seconded, and approved; 
2. The minutes from the February 17 meeting were moved, seconded, and approved 
(with three changes); 
3. The minutes from the April 3 meeting were moved, seconded, and approved; 
4. The RFP for a new truck was discussed, then moved, seconded, and approved;  
5. The Fire District's personnel policy was discussed; changes are being presented and 
discussed awaiting a total review of the policy, when changes will be voted by the 
Prudential Committee;  
6. The department's operations report was discussed, then moved, seconded, and 
approved; 
7. Other agenda items were postponed until the next meeting; 
8. The next PC meeting date was agreed to be May 19 at 3:30 p.m. 

The PC adjourned the meeting at 4:58. 


Steve Allen, Clerk
